Package: InkAgro
Title: Automated Analysis of Agricultural Field Experiments in Spanish
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bryan Joseph", "Chavez Velaisosa", , "7366989122@untrm.edu.pe", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analyses agricultural field experiments with a single call: reads the data, verifies that its structure matches the declared experimental design (completely randomised, randomised complete block, two-factor factorial and split-plot designs), fits the analysis of variance, checks the model assumptions, flags outliers without silently removing them, and compares treatment means with the tests implemented in 'agricolae', using least-squares means when plots are missing. It also tidies hand-made field spreadsheets (title rows, summary rows, merged cells, blocks in columns) and records every change. Results are reported in Spanish for students and researchers without prior training in R.
